Common CTEProgram [500]
    documentation "The career cluster or pathway representing the career path of the Vocational/Career Tech concentrator."
    descriptor CareerPathway [799]
        documentation "A sequence of courses within an area of interest that is a student's educational road map to a chosen career."
        is part of identity
    shared string CIPCode [800]
        documentation "Number and description of the CIP code associated with the student's CTE program."
        is optional
    bool PrimaryCTEProgramIndicator [802]
        documentation "A boolean indicator of whether this CTE program is the student's primary CTE program."
        is optional
    bool CTEProgramCompletionIndicator [801]
        documentation "A boolean indicator of whether the student has completed the CTE program."
        is optional